ARMORED FIRE.

ECHO-1 AND ECHO-3 ARE ORDERED TO PROCEED NORTH THROUGH OPFOR
CONTROLLED TERRITORY. YOUR MISSION OBJECTIVE IS TO REACH ECHO-
2 AT HILL 231 IN BRAVO SECTOR. 

ALL FIELDED RUSSIAN UNITS ARE DESIGNATED TARGETS. 

BE ADVISED, RUSSIAN FORCES HAVE SATURATED OUTLYING ZONES WITH
MINEFIELDS AND REINFORCED BUNKERS. THEIR GOAL IS TO PRESS 1ST 
AND 2ND PLATOONS DOWN WHAT HAS BEEN DESIGNATED SIERRA CORRIDOR. 

G-3 OPERATIONS HAVE GIVEN A VERY BRIEF OPERATIONAL WINDOW FOR THE
COMPLETION OF THIS MISSION. 

